      "mergeID": "5bc6fddc4867014419609112",
      "mergedPostDetails": "Can we get some catagories for sorting worlds? Sometimes I want to look up game maps in vrchat or puzzle maps and end up having to sort through hundreds of worlds whose only indicator that they might be a puzzle map is their name. I’m not asking for world descriptions(although that would be nice too), I’m just asking to have World creators be able to give their worlds tags so then I can search for worlds by catagory rather than name. If I’m in the mood for horror then I could search worlds listed as horror or if I wanted a dance world then I could search under dance.",
      "mergedPostTitle": "World Tags (Searching worlds by catagory)",
      "parentID": null,
      "pinned": false,
      "postDeleted": false,
      "postID": "5b848691de8b4b134c006180",
      "private": false,
      "reactions": null,
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I think this will be extremely essential in the future, because if there are many worlds and a person wants a certain spectrum of worlds, they are going to need a search/ tag system for this.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
